{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"577593c9-7ee8-4047-96a8-eddbe988a147","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam Nigeria Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-nigeria-track","description":"\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSuperteam Nigeria is the local hub of the global Superteam network, supporting builders, founders, and contributors in Nigeria to learn, build, connect, earn and grow within the Solana ecosystem.\u003cbr\u003eCrypto World’s Fair brings builders from across the world’s leading blockchain ecosystems into one open competition. This side track is our way of backing the strongest Nigerian founders taking part.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHackathon Track Scope\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThis listing is a side track dedicated to Nigerian projects built under the supervision of Superteam Nigeria that deliver meaningful value to the Solana ecosystem during the Crypto World’s Fair Hackathon period. To qualify, you must participate in the build stations, hacker hostel, or virtual boot camps, and project review sessions.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou must register for the hackathon on the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e \u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eColosseum platform\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e and mark “Nigeria” as your country.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou must submit into the Solana ecosystem track of Crypto World’s Fair hackathon and mark \"Nigeria\" as your country.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYou must provide a working product or prototype that the judges can evaluate.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs.\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e \u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eWorld's Fair Hackathon Rules\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThe Project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal and on our Superteam Earn side track.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eThe judging criteria for the NG Track will mirror those of the global hackathon. This means the following criteria will be considered: product functionality, potential impact, novelty, UX, whether or not open-sourced, and business plan.\u003cbr\u003eAttend at least 3 out of all our pitch reviews and then demo day.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReward Structure\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eTotal prize pool of $5,000 USDG\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e1st Place: $2,500 USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e2nd Place: $1,500 USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e3rd Place: $1,000 USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003ehttps://colosseum.com/worldsfair\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://build.superteam.fun/\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(99, 102, 241);\"\u003e\u003cu\u003eSuperteam Build\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e, if you’re looking for ideas to build\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\